        <mxCell id="CeNj4uSWV4GNdDWi5vfT-4" value="If any PDF which has watermark, it will be stored in a separate folder -&amp;gt; /&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;pdf_with_watermark&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
