        <mxCell id="CeNj4uSWV4GNdDWi5vfT-15" value="Each PDF will be picked and sent to an external service to convert it to DOCX file and all the DOCX file will be stored in folder -&amp;gt; /&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;all_converted_docx&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="CeNj4uSWV4GNdDWi5vfT-27">
